  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A long-wearing baked bronzer that’s lightweight and non-comedogenic for blurred, bronzed skin with a natural-radiant finish.<br><b><br>Finish: </b>Radiant <br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Pressed Powder<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Hyaluronic Acid: Locks hydration in the skin. <br>- Ethically Sourced, Finely Milled Mica: For a radiant, brightened effect.<br>- Plant-Derived Squalane: Hydration support.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> SuperSuede™ Bronzer delivers an effortless, natural-radiant bronze every time. This talc-free, velvety formula baked in Italy creates a healthy bronze glow that lasts all day—never cakey, orange, or glittery. Available in shades developed to work across a range of skin tones and types.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>-Lightly swirl The All Over Powder Brush (sold separately) into the SuperSuede™ Bronzer pan.&nbsp;</p><p>-Softly sweep across top of forehead (where the sun hits) and under cheekbones, over bridge of nose, and under the jawline for a natural-radiant bronze.</p><p>-Saie's Artistry Tip:&nbsp;</p><p>For deeper dimension or longer wear, stack SuperSuede™ Bronzer on top of Dew Bronze™ or Sun Melt.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Hyaluronic Acid: Helps to lock hydration in the skin. <br>-Ethically Sourced, Finely Milled Mica: For a radiant, brightened effect.<br>-Plant-Derived Squalane: Hydration support.<br><br>Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Mica, Squalane, Silica, Jojoba Esters, Hectorite, Boron Nitride, Octyldodecanol, Zinc Stearate, Alumina, Aqua/Water/Eau, Cellulose, Ethylhexylglycerin, Glycerin, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Sodium Benzoate, Tin Oxide, Tocopherol. [+/- MAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR: TITANIUM DIOXIDE (CI 77891), IRON OXIDES (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), BISMUTH OXYCHLORIDE (CI 77163).</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Radiant Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Pressed Powder Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Non-Comedogenic</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A long-wearing baked bronzer that’s lightweight and non-comedogenic for blurred, bronzed skin with a natural-radiant finish.<br><b><br>Finish: </b>Radiant <br><b><br>Formulation: </b>Pressed Powder<br><b><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Hyaluronic Acid: Locks hydration in the skin. <br>- Ethically Sourced, Finely Milled Mica: For a radiant, brightened effect.<br>- Plant-Derived Squalane: Hydration support.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> SuperSuede™ Bronzer delivers an effortless, natural-radiant bronze every time. This talc-free, velvety formula baked in Italy creates a healthy bronze glow that lasts all day—never cakey, orange, or glittery. Available in shades developed to work across a range of skin tones and types.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><p><strong>Suggested Usage:<br></strong>-Lightly swirl The All Over Powder Brush (sold separately) into the SuperSuede™ Bronzer pan.&nbsp;</p><p>-Softly sweep across top of forehead (where the sun hits) and under cheekbones, over bridge of nose, and under the jawline for a natural-radiant bronze.</p><p>-Saie's Artistry Tip:&nbsp;</p><p>For deeper dimension or longer wear, stack SuperSuede™ Bronzer on top of Dew Bronze™ or Sun Melt.</p></div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Hyaluronic Acid: Helps to lock hydration in the skin. <br>-Ethically Sourced, Finely Milled Mica: For a radiant, brightened effect.<br>-Plant-Derived Squalane: Hydration support.<br><br>Synthetic Fluorphlogopite, Mica, Squalane, Silica, Jojoba Esters, Hectorite, Boron Nitride, Octyldodecanol, Zinc Stearate, Alumina, Aqua/Water/Eau, Cellulose, Ethylhexylglycerin, Glycerin, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Potassium Sorbate, Sodium Acetylated Hyaluronate, Sodium Benzoate, Tin Oxide, Tocopherol. [+/- MAY CONTAIN/PEUT CONTENIR: TITANIUM DIOXIDE (CI 77891), IRON OXIDES (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), BISMUTH OXYCHLORIDE (CI 77163).</div></details>",
